With these changes:

- `renderWidth`/`renderHeight` become the actual backing‐store dimensions of the canvas.
- The CSS transform (which positions and scales the canvas) is centered on the enlarged canvas.
- Any rotated geometries will now lie entirely within the canvas and will no longer be clipped.
